          "docs": "This endpoint is designed for complex shipping applications, route planning, and back-track vessel analysis. Submit up to 1000 waypoints and timestamps in a single request body. The API responds with the marine weather conditions for each location and timestamp pair in GeoJSON format.\n\nQuota calculation: Please note that the quota charged is based on the number of locations or waypoints in your API requests, and not the number of requests. One request with 1000 locations uses the same API quota "
