          "docs": "This endpoint provides helpful context in JSON format about the marine weather parameters and operations that the other endpoints support.\n\nUse query parameters to control the results in the response body:\n  * Set `category` to either `hourlyForecast` or `hourlyHistorical` to filter marine parameters by that category.\n  * Specify a `name` to filter marine parameters by that name (e.g., `name=airTemp`).\n  * Specify a `category` and `name` to filter by both.\n  * Omit all query parameters to obtain"
